<title>USA: Ahmanson asks for retally of consent vote.</title>
<headline>Ahmanson asks for retally of consent vote.</headline>
<dateline>IRWINDALE, Calif 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>H.F. Ahmanson and Co on Wednesday said it asked CT Corporation Systems to recertify its earlier tally of Great Western Financial Corp shares voted in favor of Ahmanson's consent proposals.</p>
<p>Great Western on Monday said it filed suit in Delaware, alleging that Ahmanson &quot;double counted&quot; on some proposals.</p>
<p>CT, an independent inspector, was selected for the certification by Great Western, which has spurned Ahmanson's unsolicited takeover bid and agreed to merge with Washington Mutual Inc.</p>
</text>
